<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Ngalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu Ngalaatiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ngalaatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ngl</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a Pahuli huli</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ngalatiya</para>
  <para style="iot">Kotili Muhanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli asonihi muhanda huli mabundu ma Bakristo ma Ngalatiya, ma mali hu Noode a tsi a Turikiya ya loloyi. Ŋa hati li mabundu mo maana, huli na mabundu ma Pahuli hatelimisi mu mudyenge a nde wu isalu wa moole na wu mutatu. Nde atehe mbisa, bakima baayalongese mambu ma maasobono na ndongisili a nde. Hu Ngalatiya, hwaba na Bakristo ba baaba Bayudaayo. Bayudaayo mo baana baaba baakangama mu mikele mya bo. Hutso mikele mo miina, hwaba na mukele wu akaliha udya na Bangoyi, titswene mukele wu akatuma ketili. Buuna, ndongisili a Pahuli yaakaakini na yi Bayudaayo. Wuuna ni ngu musamu a muhanda Pahuli huli bisu Ngalatiya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli li mu usalila manzila matatu mu ulongese bisu Ngalatiya, buni imiinu mu Kristo hyusobo muutu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="io1">Nzila yatsomi<char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1-2">1–2</ref> </char>, Pahuli li mu umweese buni nde wu aba Muyudaayo, hayaki teelili a Kristo, mu uyalongese Bangoyi. Ndongisili a nde ni yiniiyi: Utwala ukwamisa Bakristo ba bavele Bayudaayo mikele mi Bayudaayo ve. Nde ayibwili Peetelo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 2:11-21">2.11-21</ref></char>) moonyi ti: baatu bali <char style="em">mu uya huli Nzambi, bu bali mu usa imiinu mu Yisu Kristo, </char> ka a mu tsiingili mikele ve.</para>
  <para style="io1">Nzila ya moole<char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 3-4">3–4</ref></char>, ni yi Pahuli ali mu uteleme ŋa yulu bisono bya nzuhisini li likulu. Mikele mili mu uva bungodu huli baatu mu uyene hu busu. Ka Pahuli li humweese ti, Lahi la Nzambi laatwsamini mikele. Kristo ni kuhisili a nzuhisini mo liina. <char style="em">A huli na muutu wu afulala wuna tsalu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi</char> ve. Boosi bali likoongo na Nzambi mu Yisu Kristo (utala mu <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">3.28</ref></char>). Mali mu utala baatu ba mabundu moosi: huba Muyudaayo tso ngoyi, makabu moosi, huba muviha tso wuli bunyanga, mukaasu tso bahala. Boosi baakangama mu Yisu Kristo.</para>
  <para style="io1">Nzila yi mutatu, mabuli ma <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 5-6">5–6</ref></char> Pahuli li mu umweese buni Bakristo bali baatu ba bunyanga na ba baakuha mu imiinu. Muutu wu miisa imiinu, utwala ubweba na mangongo mu tooni a kuhili a nde mwakulu ve (utala mu <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 3:11">3.11</ref></char>). Nde aka bunyanga<char style="em">mu bana</char>. Mu tooni ati,<char style="em">matumili a mali mutso mukele a Kristo</char> ve. Ka mukele a Kristo, li mu uvondo mu ubitasana mipfuna. Uba bunyanga, ni ubita mipfuna mya bana (<char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 6:2">6.2</ref></char>), hu tsina a tumili Livupu la Nzambi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Me Pahuli, wu li iluumbi hya Nzambi, me a handi iluumbi hya Nzambi mu tsolili a baatu, tso mu litondo la muutu ve. Ka me ndi iluumbi mu teelili a Yisu Kristo na Nzambi Taata, wu asuula nde ŋa hati la ba bakwa. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Me na baana ba ngu boosi ba bali na me huni, lili itwadi mu utsindaha muhanda mo wunuuwu, huli mabundu ma itaanzi hya Ngalatiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Nyaha Nzambi Taata a bisu na Pfumu Yisu Kristo, bava benu hyese na hyenze. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Kristo wu asiinga, we bu hwaba litondo la Nzambi, mu uyeholo muvumu a nde we bungodu, mu uyobolo bisu mu masumu ma bisu, mu upatula bisu mu matwala ma mabi ma tsi mo yiniiyi. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Nyaha muyusu akwilala huli Nzambi Taata a bisu, mu bilima na bilima! Ameni!<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Velo-velo a bisu Ngalatiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Me ndi mu ukimuha bu benu laaveletamba mu umiinguha Nzambi. Nde wu ateele benu mu hyese hya Kristo. Benu laaka mu ukinguha mu uyuha Musamu wu Mubwe mukima. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Ka, a huli na Musamu wu Mubwe mukima ve. Bunuubu, huli na baatu ba bali mu usa muyungisi ŋa hati la benu, na ba batondi usobo Musamu wu Mubwe wa Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ka tso bisu mwakulu, buuve pofi a hu yulu, yayabisa benu Musamu wu Mubwe wu asobono na wu bisu laayabisi benu, nyaha Nzambi asinga nde! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Bisu laatswamini uleele benu lo, na me mbwendeele lo loloyi: tso muutu yayabisa benu Musamu wu Mubwe wu asobono na wu benu laayaka, nyaha Nzambi asinga nde. <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Na bunuubu, benu litsimi ti me ndi mu utsaha ti baatu basilasa me? Naana! Nzambi ni wu afwana usilasa me. Benu lili mu utsima ti me na nzala umonehele wu mubwe ŋa hati la baatu? Naana! Tso me ndi mu utsaha ti baatu bakubala me tsambi, me a hakiimba musalili a Kristo ve.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buni Pahuli hakituhi iluumbi hya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Me ndeele benu lo baana ba ngu, Musamu wu Mubwe wu me umbaanzabisa benu, a hali wu matsimi ma muutu ve.<verse eid="GAL 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Mu tooni ati, a muutu alongese na uyakisa me nde ve. Ka Yisu Kristo nde mwakulu ni wu abaanguli me nde.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Benu laayuhi buni mbiili a me yaaba taangu a tsomi bu me akatsalila bukulu bu Bayudaayo. Me akatsuta libundu la Nzambi mu iteesi hi hyafulala na ubaatsala lo. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Me akapfula ubwaha ŋa hati li Bayudaayo ba tungi la me, mu ukuhasa bukulu bu Bayudaayo. Me amba apfulala bo lehemene ŋa busu bu bukulu bu bakaaha ba bisu. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ka Nzambi asooli me tswamina mbutili a me. Na mu hyese hya nde, nde ateeli me mu uba musalili a nde. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Tangu yi nde havoli kesili mu ubangula me Mwana a nde, mana me nzabisa Musamu wu Mubwe huli ba bavele Bayudaayo, me a hapondi buyedi huli pasi muutu ve. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Me a hakumisi hu musyenge a Yeruselemi mu uyabwana na ba baatswamini me, mu uba biluumbi bya Nzambi ve. Ka me anzyeni hu tsi a Arabiya, titswene me anzapfutaha hu musyenge a Damaseko. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Humbisa bilima bitatu, me akumisi hu Yeruselemi, mu uyabana na Peetelo. Me apyosi bilumbu kuumi na bitaanu huli nde. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Ka me a hamoni biluumbi bya Nzambi bikima ve, ŋa yulu a Yaki, mwaana a ngu a Pfumu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Nzambi li mbangi a me! Bu me ndi mu utsonehele benu mambu mo maniima, me a handi mu upfuta ve. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Titswene, me anzyeni hu bitaanzi bya Siriya na Silisiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Mabundu ma Bakristo baa itaanzi hya Yuda, aba kini abaayabi me ve. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Mo maayuhi ndulu ti: «Wu akakwamisa bisu hutsomi, aka mu ulongese loloyi Musamu wu Mubwe wu imiinu, wu nde hakasaha utsala». <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Na mabundu maakayusa Nzambi mu tooni a me.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Titswene, humbisa bilima kuumi na bina, me ambwekumasa hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, bisu a Baranabasi. Me ambiti kaka Tiite. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Me anzyeni huuna mu nzabisili yi Livupu. Me anzabisi bo Musamu wu Mubwe, wu me umbandongese ŋa hati la ba bavele Bayudaayo. Me ambahi imoho hya ŋa muvanga, na ba baakomo hutso libundu. Titswene, me a hantondi ve ti isalu hi me atsiidi hutsomi, na hi me ndi mu utsa loloyi, hiba hya mu pu. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Mono buni bo baavelituma mu ukete Tiite, wu aba na me, na wu aba Ngeleke. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Bwavangimi buuna, mu tooni a banga muwala ŋa hati la baana ba ngu, ba baayasohono na bisu na ubaakete bisu. Bo baakakete bisu, mu bunyanga bu laaba na bwo mu Yisu Kristo. Tsimi a bo, aba yi ufutala bisu hutso buviha. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Ka bisu a laayuhili bo tso taangu mosi ve, a laakulimini ka ŋa busu bwa bo ve, mana imbuli hi Musamu wu Mubwe hikwilala ŋa hati la benu. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Ka mu ba baakamonehele we baatu ba baakomo, bupfumu bwa bo a bwaba na tsalu ŋa busu bwa me ve. Mu tooni ati, Nzambi a hubaatondo buraandu ve! Baatu mo baana a baakwihi me pasi hyo, hwavele litondo la me ve. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Ka bo baamoni ti Nzambi aviidi me mupfuna wu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe huli ba baavelekete. Ni bumosi kaka, huli Peetelo, nde avidi mupfuna wu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe huli ba baakete. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Nzambi wu ateeli Peetelo mu uba iluumbi hya nde huli buli la ba baakete, ateeli kaka me, mana me mba iluumbi hya nde huli bangoyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Yaki, Peetelo na Yowani ba baaba makuunzi ma libundu, baasilisi ti Nzambi, mu hyese hya nde, aviidi me mupfuna wu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe huli bangoyi. Na bo baayasiimba bisu a Baranabasi, mu umweese ti bisu a bo laayuhisini mu uba likoongo. Ni mu buuna, bisu a bo laakesi mu itwadi, ti bisu liyakuhasa isalu ŋa hati li bangoyi, mana bo bayasala ŋa hati la buli la ba baakete. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Bo baavondi bisu dyaambu limosi: bisu lafwana ubaayibwala banga a puumbu moonyi. Me akuhisi maana ma bo baavondi bisu, na bukuhu boosi.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli li mu usyembe Peetelo hu Antyokya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ka taangu yi Peetelo hayidi hu musyenge a Antyokya, me atsyembi nde ŋa misu ma baatu, mu tooni ati nde avangi ma mabi. Mono ma nde havangi. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Tswamina baatu ba kabu la Yaki mu uya, nde aba mu udya itwadi na baana ba ngu ba bavele Bayudaayo. Ka, humbisa hu bo baayato, nde avyasuhi na nde ayatsahala ŋa muvanga, mu tooni ati, nde aba na boomo bwa kabu la baatu mo baana, ba baakete. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Bayudaayo bakima baa musyenge mo wuuna, baasiidi we Peetelo. Baranabasi nde mwakulu kaka, akoti hutso a ndyatili a bo yi muwala. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Me amoni ti ndyatili a bo a yaaba yi yasungama we bu Musamu wu Mubwe ali mu uvondo ve. Buuna, me anzabisi Peetelo ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi ti: «Mbiili a we wu li Muyudaayo, yili we mbiili bangoyi, ka a we bu hwafwana na mikele mi Bayudaayo ve. Uba ti ni buuna, buni we ukwamisa ba bavele Bayudaayo, mu udyata we bu hwafwana huli Bayudaayo?»<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayudaayo na bangoyi sa bayoboho mu imiinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Bisu a benu lili Bayudaayo ba imbutala-ngu. Bisu a lili baa mabuli ma ba baasumaha ve. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Bisu liyaabi ti Nzambi ni wu ubaasa ti muutu aba wu akuha mu imiinu hya nde mu Yisu Kristo. Ka a bu nde ubaaduukala Mikele mya Moose ve. Mono buni bisu Bayudaayo kaka, laamiisa imiinu mu Yisu Kristo, mana bisu liba ba baakuha mu imiinu mu nde. Bisu a lili ba baakuha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, mu kuhisili Mikele mo minimi ve. Muutu tso mumosi utwala umonehele wu akuha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, bu nde ubaakuhasa Mikele ve. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Ka bisu lili mu usaha uba ba baakuha mu bungodu bu laabaha mu Kristo. Ni mu uleele ti, bisu a lili mu uduukala Mikele mya bisu ve. Ka a mu uleele ti Kristo li mu ubita bisu mu usa masumu ve. Naana, a huli buuna ve! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ni mu buuna, tso me ndi mu umbwepfutahala tuungili Mikele yi me atsali, me ndi mu umbwekituha iyahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Mu ma maatala Mikele, me ndi we wu amiikwa na me a hatsaali hu tsina lituma li bisiha mo biina ve. Buuna ni bu hwafwana, mana me mbaha moonyi mu Nzambi. Baamikomene me ŋa muti a Kuruwa, itwadi na Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Ni mu buuna, a me ndi moonyi ve, ka ni Kristo li moonyi mu me. Idiingu hya me ŋa toto, ni mu imiinu mu Mwana a Nzambi me ndi mu ukuhasa hyo. Nde wu atondi me, ayehuli moonyi a nde mu tooni a me. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Me a handi mu ubisa hyese hya Nzambi ve. Tso muutu li wu akuha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi mu nzila Mikele, buuna Kristo mu pu hakwidi.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mikele tso imiinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Benu bisu Ngalatiya, ba baavele buyedi! Na aloho benu? Baamweesi benu paayalala, buni baakomini Yisu Kristo ŋa muti. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Me tondi ti benu liva me ndulu mvutu mu hyuhu mo hinihi: Benu laayaka Livupu la Nzambi, mu tooni a bu benu laakuhasa Mikele mya Moose myosi? Vooti mu tooni ati benu laasiidi imiinu mu Musamu wu Mubwe wu benu laayuhi? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Buni benu lu utwala uba na butsudu bwa pila yi? Bi benu laabaandiha mu Livupu la Nzambi, benu litondi usukasa mu mifudi mya benu mwakulu? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Moosi ma benu laabingala, maka ma mu pu? Naana! Mo utwala uba ma mu pu ve! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Ni buuna, Nzambi wu ava benu Livupu la nde na wu li mu uvanga bipadi ŋa hati la benu, a hali mu ukuhasa maana mu tooni ati benu lili mu udyata hutso Mikele mya nde ve. Ka mu tooni, ati benu lili mu usa imiinu mu Musamu wu Mubwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Abrahami asiidi imiinu mu Nzambi, na Nzambi amoni nde muutu wu akuha, mu tooni imiinu mo hina. <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Benu lafwana mu uyaaba lo: Babali na imiinu mu Nzambi, ni bo bali baana ba Abrahami. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Nzambi aleeli mu mambu ma nde, ti nde sa akitusa babavele Bayudaayo mu uba baatu ba baakuha mu imiinu ŋa busu bwa nde. Ni mu buuna, nde abweleele huli Abrahami dyaambu lilibwe li: «Nzambi sa asyeme bibandu bya ŋa toto byosi, mu tooni a we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Mba 15.6</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Abrahami asiidi imiinu mu Nzambi na baasyemi nde. Ni mu buuna, boosi babali mu usa imiinu sa basyeme bo, we bu baasyemi Abrahami nga imiinu. <verse eid="GAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Ka babali mu usingama mu Mikele mya Moose, baamikoto mu tsingili, we bu baasonehe bunuubu: «Aba wu baasinga, woosi wu avelehwada mu usalila moosi ma baasonehe mutso muhanda Mikele.» <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Imbuli ni ti, a huli na muutu tso mumosi wu utwala uba wu akuha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi mu tooni Mikele ve. Mu tooni ati, hutso Muhanda Mikele baasonehe bunubu: «Woosi wu Nzambi hubaasa ti nde aba wu akuha mu imiinu hya nde, sa aba moonyi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2.4</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Ka Mikele a myasingama mu imiinu ve. Na baabwesonehe bu: «Woosi wu li mu usalila mamali mu Mikele, sa aba moonyi mu myo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Pfu 27.26</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Bu Kristo akituhi iloho hya tsingili ŋa mbuha a bisu, nde ayobili bisu mu tsingili Mikele. Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: « Aba wu baasinga, pasi nde wu akwa mu swe ŋa muti<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Pfu 21.23</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Ni mu buuna, lisyeme li baasiidi Abrahami nzuhisini, laatoodi kaka huli bangoyi, mu tooni a Yisu Kristo, na mu nzila imiinu, bisu boosi lili mu uyaka Livupu li Nzambi asiidi nzuhisini.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikele na nzuhisini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Baana baa ngu, me polo benu ifwaani mu mbiili a bisu ya pasi ilumbu, mana benu litsikaha ma me tondi uleele: ŋa muutu amiisonehe nzuhisini la nde bu hwafwana, teehele nde mu ukwa, tso muutu mumosi utwala utuna lo, tso ubwese iloho imosi ŋa yulu ve. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Ni buuna ka, Nzambi hasiidi manzuhisini ma nde huli Abrahami na huli mwaana a nde. Mabasonehe a mali mu uleele ve ti: «Huli baana ba nde». Ka we wu uleele ti, hi hyabaha ba banzuhisini. Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele ti: «Huli mwaana nde.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Mba 12.7</ref></char></note>» Ni mu umweese ti ndulu muutu mumosi akangama mu lo, ni Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Me tondi uleele bunuubu: Nzambi abandihi usa nzuhisini we bu hwafwana. Mikele mya Moose mi myayidi humbisa maakama mana maku matatu ma bilima, utwala ufwinzala kesili mo yiina, tso umaasa nzuhisini ya Nzambi ve. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ka tso mukobe wu Nzambi ubaava, li mu uyila mu nzila Mikele, buuna a husaali mu tooni a nzuhisini ve. Ka Nzambi aviidi Abrahami lisyeme mu nzila a nzuhisini. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Tsalu Mikele aba ki yo? Baabwesi Mikele ndulu mu umweese huli baatu, mavaanga ma bo ma mabi. Sa huba buuna, natee bu imbisa hya Abrahami hi baasili nzuhisini, hyuya. Mikele mo minimi bapofi baasanguli myo, humbisa a nzonzi mumosi, Moose. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Nzonzi ubaateleme ŋa boole bamiikakana. Ka mu tooni a nzuhisini, Nzambi ndulu siha ali. <verse eid="GAL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Utwala mu uleele ti Mikele mili mu ulwanisa manzuhisini ma Nzambi? Naana! Utwala uvangama ve! Tso baaviidi matwala huli mukele mu uva moonyi huli baatu, buuna mukele akiikitusa baatu baba ba baakuha. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ka Mabasonehe ma Ngidi, mali mu uleele ti toto yoosi yili hutso lituma li masumu. Toto yili yi yasumaha, mana banga a imiinu mu Yisu Kristo bayaka bungodu bu Nzambi hasiidi bo nzuhisini.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imiinu na mukobe wu baasiidi nzuhisini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Tswamina imiinu mu uya, bisu laabedi hu tsina Mikele, baakatihala, mu ubaakeele taangu yi Nzambi hubangula bisu imiinu. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Ni mu buuna, Mikele myaba we keedi wu ubita bisu huli Kristo. Mana bisu liba ba baakuha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, mu nzila imiinu. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Ka bu imiinu hyamiiya, bisu a laasaala hu tsina lituma la keedi mo wuuna ve. <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Mu taangu mo yiniiyi, benu boosi laaka baana ba Nzambi mu imiinu mu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Mu tooni ati, benu boosi ba baatondehe mu Kristo, benu laamiilwata Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />A husaali na lisobosono ŋa hati li Muyudaayo na Mungeleke ve, ŋa hati li muviha na wu li bunyanga, ŋa hati li mukaasu na bahala. Benu boosi laaka mumosi mu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Umono ti benu lili baa Kristo, benu lili imbisa hya Abrahami. Na benu sa liba babyalili ba mukobe wu Nzambi hasiidi nzuhisini huli Abrahami.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Mono ma me tondi uleele: Bu mubyalili mukobe akini mwaana a ngebe, lisobosono love ŋa hati la nde na muviha. Tso bu babaaleele ti byosi bya nde. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Nde li hu tsina lituma la keedi a nde, na la baatu ba bali mu ukeelese busina bwa nde, natee mu taangu yi taata a nde hakese. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Bisu kaka ni pila mosi, bu laaba bikenyi, bisu laabeedi baviha baa mavupu ma mali mu utuma tsi. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Bu taangu yi baakese yaatoodi, Nzambi atsindihi Mwana a nde: Wu mukaasu habuti, wu aba hu tsina Mikele mi Bayudaayo. <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />Mwana mo hayidi mu uyobolo ba baaba hu tsina lituma li Mikele, na mu uva bisu bunyanga mu ukituha baana ba Nzambi. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Mu tooni ati, benu ni baana ba nde, Nzambi atsindihi mutso mitima mya bisu, Livupu la Mwana a nde, Livupu li libaafulaha: «Abba! Taata!» <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Ni mu buuna, we a hasaala muviha ve, ka we mwaana. Mu tooni ati we li mwaana, we mubyalili mukobe, wu Nzambi haswehele baana ba nde.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boomo bwa Pahuli mu tooni a bisu Ngalatiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Hutsomi, benu aba a laayaba Nzambi ve. Benu laabedi baviha ba banzambi ba bali binzanzambi. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ka bunuubu, bu benu limiiyaaba Nzambi, buuve bu Nzambi amiyaaba benu, buni benu lu ubwefutahala hutso lituma li mavupu mo maana? Mavupu ma bumvwemvengi, na ubwekituha baviha baa mo? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Benu lili mu uvolo taangu yindahi, mu ubaatsikaha bilumbu, batsungi, makesili ma matangu na bilima. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Me ndi na boomo ti, isalu hi me anzatsala ŋa hati la benu, hiba hya mu pu. <verse eid="GAL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Baana baa ngu, me ndi mu unzayaana huli benu. Baani we me mu tooni ati, me ndi we benu. Benu a laavangila me dyaambu lilibi tso limosi ve.<verse eid="GAL 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Yibwalaani moonyi ti, taangu yi me anzabisi benu Musamu wu Mubwe, yabisa latsomi, me amba mubeedu. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Na mu bubeedu bwa me, bu bwakakwamisa benu, benu a laanyasuli me, tso ubelele me ve. Ka benu laayaki me we pofi a Nzambi, we Yisu Kristo nde mwakulu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Ki pila a kinya benu laaba na yo! Ka hima hya yiila benu? Me ndi mu utiila benu imbangi mo hinihi: tso hwafwani uba buuna, kini benu laasonzili miisu ma benu, mu uva me mo. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Bunuubu, me ka muboho a benu bu me miinzabisa benu imbuli? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Baatu mo baana, ba bali mu usaha uyabisa benu Musamu wu Mubwe mukima, lehemene la bo mu benu a lili lilibwe ve. Bo bali mu usaha utahusa benu na me, mana benu likangama mu bo. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Hwafwana bubwe mu ubaamweese lehemene la benu pasi taangu, mu mavaanga ma mabwe. Ka ndulu a mu taangu yi me ndi ŋa hati la benu ve. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Baana ba me, we mukaasu nga misoongo, me ndi mu umbwemono misoongo mu benu, we me wu li mu ubwebuta benu. Misoongo mo miina myukwilala natee bu Kristo huuba moonyi mu benu. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Me tondi uba itwadi na benu, na usobo bitoyili. Mu tooni ati, matsimi ma me mali mu uhelene mu benu.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lahi li buviha na nzuhisini li bunyanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Leelaani ati me, benu baa litondi uba hu tsina lituma li Mikele, benu a lili mu uyuha ma Mikele mili mu uleele ve? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Mu tooni ati, mu mabuuku ma Moose baasonehe ti Abrahami abahi baana boole ba babahala. Mumosi wu a na mukaasu wu muviha, wuna na mukaasu wu bunyanga. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Ka wu nde habuti na mukaasu wu muviha, baabuti nde mu litondo li musunya. Wu nde habuti na mukaasu wu bunyanga, baabuti nde mu nzila ya nzuhisini la Nzambi. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Kuma mo yiniiyi, yili na mbindulili yi yasweme: bakaasu baboole bali mu umweese manzuhisini moole. Lahi limosi mu mamoole, li baasiidi ŋa yulu isyelo hya Sinayi. Ni mu lo baabuti baana babali baviha, mu nzila ya Agali. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Buuna Agali ni isyelo hya Sinayi hu tsi a Arabiya. Nde li mu ufwanina na Yeruselemi la loloyiniyi. Mu tooni ati, nde li mu buviha na baana ba nde. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ka Yeruselemi ya hu yulu, yili bunyanga. Yo ni ngu a bisu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Mu tooni ati, baasonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">«Ba mu kinya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">We mukaasu inguma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">we wu avele na baana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">fulaha mu kinya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">We wu aveleyaaba misoongo mya mbutili!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Mu tooni ati, litangu la baana ba mukaasu wu baatimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">lu ulutaala la baana ba mukaasu wu baakwele<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Esa 54.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Ka benu, baana ba ngu, benu lili we Isaki: baana ba baabuta we bu huli nzuhisini la Nzambi! <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ka we mu taangu a tsomi, mwaana wu baabuti mu makila akatsuta wu baabuti mu Livupu la Nzambi. Loloyi kaka, huli mu uvagama buuna. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Ka Mabasonehe ma Ngidi, mali mu uleele bunuubu: «Binga muviha mo wunuuwu na mwaana a nde. Mu tooni ati, a hwafwana ti mwaana wu mukaasu muviha abuta, akaba mukobe a taata na mwaana wu mukaasu bunyanga abuta ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Mba 21.10</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Ni mu buuna, baana ba ngu, bisu a benu a lili baana ba mukaasu wuli muviha ve. Ka bisu a benu baana ba mukaasu wuli bunyanga.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo li mu uva bunyanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kristo ava bisu bunyanga mana bisu liba bunyanga mu mbuli. Ni mu buuna, hwadaani mu ubwevelefutaha hutso a ikoholo hi buviha. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Yuhaani! Me Pahuli ndi mu undeele benu lo: Tso baketi benu mu uba ba baasungama ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, buuna Kristo a hasaali na tsoongo huli benu ve. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Me ndi mu umbwetsitasa lo siitasa likima, huli pasi muutu wu bali mu ukete: nde afwana ubaasiingala Mikele myosi. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Benu baa libaasaha usungama ŋa miisu ma Nzambi, ndulu mu kuhisili Mikele, benu laamiitahuha na Kristo. Benu lamiipala mu lisyeme la Nzambi. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Ka bisu, baa laasa hiitu hya bisu mu Nzambi, bisu lili mu ukeele mu mutima a bisu woosi. Nde sa asuungaha bisu ŋa busu bwa nde, mu matwala ma Livupu. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Ka, mu Kristo Yisu hya tsoongo, ni imiinu hi hili mu umweese mavaanga mu mukele litondo, ka a mu uba wu baakete, buuve wu baavelekete ve. <verse eid="GAL 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Hu mbandili, ndyatili a benu aba yimbwe. Na akubasa benu baku, mu ubwevelesingala imbuli? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Ma bali mu uleele benu mu ubaha benu, a mali mu umata huli Nzambi wu li mu uteele benu ve. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Baatu ba baaleele: «Mwana a levini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">levini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iloho hi hibaadanisa paate.</char></note> hoole, libaapfunasa lidaama loosi.» <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Ka, mu bungodu bwa Pfumu, me ndi na hiitu mu tooni a benu. Me ndi na imiinu ti benu a lu uba na matsimi ma maasobono na ma me ve. Ka, pasi nde wu li mu udungasa benu, nde sa ayaka tsingili a Nzambi. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ka mu ma mamiitala me, baana ba ngu, tso me ndi mu undongese ketili, mu ki tooni bali mu ubwetsuta me? Tso ni mu buuna, me undongese maana, musamu lipfu la Yisu ŋa muti, utwala ubwekubasa pasi muutu baku ve. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Ba bali mu ubehe budyabidi ŋa hati la benu, a basuka ndulu mu ukete ve. Bo ni bayene natee mu ukese nyutu a ibahala hya bo!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukumbasana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Baana baa ngu, benu lili ba baateele mu uba bunyanga. Ka ndulu, benu a lisalila bunyanga mo buuna, mu ukuhasa mapeyu ma musunya ve. Ka nyahaani mukele litondo atuma benu, mana benu li baasalasana. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Mu tooni ati Mikele myosi mya kuukama mu dyaambu limosi; ni linili: «Tondo muna a we, we we mwakulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ka tso benu lili mu udyata we bibulu, mu ubaakahasana tso ubaabakasana, buuna benu lafwana ukele: Benu sa limana mu udubasana.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udyata mu tumili Livupu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu undeele bu: Nyahaani Livupu libaatuma idiingu hya benu. Tso lisiidi buuna, benu alubwesingala tso hole, lituma li mapeyu ma musunya ve. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Mu tooni ati musunya na mapeyu ma maakakana na ma Livupu; na Livupu kaka lili mapeyu ma maakakana na ma musunya. Bo baboole bali mu ulwana. Ni mu buuna, benu libaaveletwala usa libwe li benu litondi usa. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ka tso Livupu lili mu ubita benu, benu a lili hutso a tumili Mikele ve.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Ka mavaanga ma musunya mali ma maamonehele: ni bumbembo, mayamba, mbiili ya yayuhu, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />tsalili bifwita, bungaanga, iboho, midiingu, nyengi mu bana, mitsotso, mafufu, kabwili, makabu ma mabuli, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />peyu ubaha, kolili malamu, mikungi mi mubaka udya na unywa na mavaanga makima ma pila mo yiina. Me apfwana ubweyibusa benu we bu me mbedi amiitswamina uleele: ba bali mu usa mavaanga mo maana, a bu ukoto mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi ve.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ka mimbutu mi Livupu ni litondo, kinya, hyenze, taasili a bana, mutima wu mubwe, kangimini, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />bulembo na uyaaba utuma linyutu. Mikele a mili mu ulwanisa mavaanga ma pila mo yiina ve. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Ka boosi ba bali mu Yisu Kristo baamiiduba linyutu la bo li masumu, na mapeyu na manzala ma lo.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Livupu laava bisu moonyi. Buuna, livaani lo bunyanga mana lo lituma ndyatili a bisu. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Bisu a liba banga a nyeme ve. Na lipala mu ipfu hi ubaasongosono. A liba kaka na linyungi benu na benu ve.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ubitasana mipfuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Baana baa ngu, tso bayabiisa muutu bikuma mu uvanga lilibi, benu baa lili na livupu la Nzambi, suungahaani nde mu bulembo. Na kebe we mwakulu kaka, mu uvelebwa mu lobese. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Baabitasanaani mipfuna: buna benu sa likuhasa mukele a Kristo.<verse eid="GAL 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukengese mavaanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Tso muutu li mu unyeme mu biita la nde, hwavele uba na tsongo, nde li mu upfuta nde mwakulu. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Pasi muutu abaakengese mavaanga ma nde mwakulu. Buuna, nde utwala unyeme mu nde mwakulu, ka a mu muutu mukima ve. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Mu tooni ati, pasi muutu ahwama na mavaanga ma nde.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Nyaha muutu wu bamiilongese mambu ma Nzambi, akaba bi nde ali na byo na mulongisi a nde. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Kebaani: Nzambi a bubaakwede ve. Bi muutu ubaakuna<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:8">Yob 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 22:8">Mak 22.8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:7">Ose 8.7</ref></char></note>, ni bi nde ubaakukaha. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Woosi wu ubaakuna mu musunya, nde sa akuukaha bi byabolo; bi bibaabita hu lipfu. Ka woosi wu ubaakuna mu Livupu, nde wuuna sa akuukaha bya moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />A likolo mu uvanga ma mabwe ve. Mu tooni ati, sa likuukaha mu taangu yi yafwana, tso livelimweese ikolili. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Ni mu buuna, bu taangu yimonihili, libaavaangaani ma mabwe huli pasi muutu, fula-fula huli baana ba ngu ba imiinu mu Kristo.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandoongi ma tsyelele na mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Me mwakulu ndi mu utsonehele benu mu taangu mo yiniiyi, we bu benu lili mu udihula bunene bu bisono bya me. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Boosi ba bali mu ukwamisa benu ketili, bali mu usaha umonehele mu imuutu hya bo. Bo bali mu ukwamisa benu ketili, mana a batsundasa bo we ba bali mu usa imiinu mu kwili a Kristo ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Ka ba baakete bo mwakulu a bali mu ukiinza Mikele ve. Bo batondi ti bakete benu, mana bo basa nyeme mu ketili a benu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ka mu me, nyeme a me a yili mu biina byosi ve, ndulu mu kwili a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo ŋa kuruwa. Mu nde mavaanga ma mabi moosi mamiikwa. Me kaka amiikwa ŋa busu bu mavaanga ma tsi. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Ni mu buuna, tso huli wu baakete, buuve wu baavelekete, tsongo yove: hya tsongo, ni mu ukituha muutu wu munyatihi. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Huli boosi ba bali mu usiingala ndongisili a me, me ndi mu undeele bunuubu: Nyaha hyenze na bubwe bwa Nzambi, biba mu bo na mu buli la Nzambi loosi! <verse eid="GAL 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Bunuubu, muutu a habwesa me mangongo. Mu tooni ati, bikidi bi me ndi na byo, ni biliimbu bi bili mu umweese ti me aka wa Yisu. <verse eid="GAL 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Baana baa ngu mu Kristo, nyaha lisyeme la Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, liba na benu boosi! Ameni!<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>